  m_text: 'HOW TO PLAY

    You are Wisp, a small light in a dark world.

    Goal: Defeat the Sunken Keeper in the Chapel.



    A / D or Arrows - Move

    Space - Jump

    J or Left Click - Lantern Blade

    E - Rest at a Vow Shrine (heal + checkpoint)

    Esc - Pause

    Q - Use a Vow Flame (heals half your health).



    The more Husks you take out the higher you attack damage will be.

    Avoid spikes. Watch for an Husk''s orange flash, it means there about to attack.'
